  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>⚠️ 不适用于服务器！！！</strong></h1>\n\n<h2><strong>关于</strong></h2>\n<p>告别随机的结果，欢迎来到一个装备完美定制的世界。<br><br>\nEnchantment Reveal 让你预览所有可能的附魔效果，无需依赖运气或猜测，即可确切知道你将获得什么。<br><br></p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>由于原版服务器玩家数据的保存机制，本模组仅适用于单人游戏，<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">绝对不可在服务器上运行</span>。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2><strong>在附魔台中查看</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/946157/description_215274ec-0d1f-468b-ac6b-e8a83941fa5b.png\" alt=\"预览\" width=\"828\" height=\"664\"></p>\n\n<h2><strong>支持版本</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/185/822/256/256/636829723898798601.png\" alt=\"Fabric API - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">\n    Fabric 1.19.2 - 1.20.4 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">需要 Fabric API</a>)\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1003537/description_fddab02e-963a-4335-8cb2-48ac035fecb5.png\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">\n    Forge 1.19.2 - 1.20.4\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table style=\"margin: auto; text-align: center;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding: 20px;\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/CrownSheep/Enchantment-Reveal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/25/25231.png\" alt=\"GitHub 标志\" width=\"80\"><br>\n        <strong>‎ ‎ ‎ GitHub</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td style=\"padding: 20px;\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchantment-reveal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        ‎ ‎ ‎<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81b12a5bce3d683ff55d209e677fec6677090d24.png\" alt=\"CurseForge 标志\" width=\"70\"><br>\n        <strong>CurseForge</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
